# E-4：最终镜像构建上下文排除规则。
# 每条规则与 Dockerfile COPY 路径核对：正式数据/凭据/测试残留绝不放行。

.git
.github
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
.env.example
runtime/
**/runtime/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.db
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.zip
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credential_key
chroma/
**/chroma/
agent_data/
vanna_data/
data/
.cache/
backups/
_worktrees/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.local
.runlogs
.vscode
.idea
.claude
.agents
CLAUDE.md
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
vanna_venv
*.log
backend.log
backend.err.log
capture
*.md.pdf
docs
tests
deploy/lan
train_step3.py
integrations

# tools/ 仅保留运行期推荐问题生成管线依赖，其余测试/工具脚本不进镜像。
tools/*
!tools/generate_question_suggestions.py

